.Dd May 29, 2026
.Dt ZDOTS-LOG-ANALYZE 1
.Os zdots
.Sh NAME
.Nm zdots-log-analyze
.Nd package zdots deploy logs for diagnostics
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Ar bootstrap|update|upgrade
.Op Ar options
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
builds diagnostic packs from bootstrap, update, or upgrade logs. It includes
transcript excerpts and optional non-OTel system snapshots, so it works when
the observability stack is down.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Fl
.It Fl -summary Ar file
Use a specific summary.
.It Fl -log Ar file
Use a specific transcript.
.It Fl -tail Ar n
Include last N lines.
.It Fl -ai-timeout Ar n
AI timeout.
.It Fl -full
Include full transcript.
.It Fl -ai
Send pack to local AI.
.It Fl -no-snapshot
Skip local snapshot.
.It Fl -prompt-only
Print analysis prompt only.
.It Fl -list
List recent logs.
.It Fl h , Fl -help
Show usage.
.El
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width ZDOTS_LOG_ANALYZE_AI_TIMEOUT
.It Ev ZDOTDIR
Repository root.
.It Ev ZDOTS_LOG_DIR
Log directory.
.It Ev ZDOTS_LOG_ANALYZE_AI_TIMEOUT
Default AI timeout.
.It Ev ZDOTS_AI_MODE , Ev ZDOTS_AI_ENDPOINT , Ev ZDOTS_AI_EMBED_ENDPOINT
AI mode and endpoints.
.It Ev ZDOTS_CONTEXT , Ev ZDOTS_ENV_PROFILE
Context labels included in snapshots.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr zdots-ctx 1 ,
.Xr zdots-ctl 8
